          "text": "CHU Kuo-chên 朱國楨 (T. 文寧, H. 平涵, 虯庵), 1557–1632, Ming official and historian, was a native of Wu-ch'êng, Chekiang. A chin-shih of 1589, he was selected a bachelor of the Hanlin Academy and was later appointed a corrector.",
